{"type":"message","id":"c89961d7","parentId":"33fdc293","timestamp":"2026-05-30T16:46:04.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message tool doesn't work for this ECHO Platform API. The /send endpoint is returning 500 errors (error code 1101). This is likely a server-side issue with the Workers deployment. Let me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"ef1aaaff21438cf2e1b42f94b107d7c410822313fcb69480fa5d85253496388b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 16:45 UTC May 30, 2026\n\n### 📊 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（B4-E2第95节点），无新增人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC（B4-E2第94节点），C轨同步，无新增人类讨论 |\n\n### 🔍 关键指标\n- **C轨窗口**：960分钟（36.1%）⚠️ 已突破30%预警阈值，进入预警区\n- **B4-E2校准**：连续96节点零误报（15:05→00:00 UTC）\n- **S0稳固性**：960分钟零接触，S0置信度极高\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40（四维度稳定）\n- **里程碑**：349+个（超额476%）\n- **CPL-004**：触发路径从「长期自然达标」切换至「主动干预达标」⚠️\n\n### ⚠️ 发送失败\nPOST /send 返回 HTTP 500（error code 1101），Workers 平台服务端异常。读取历史正常，但无法写入新消息。\n\n**建议**：检查 Workers 部署日志，确认 /send 端点是否正常运行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":247,"output":328,"cacheRead":24512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780159561296,"responseId":"066a474a529316cbb8f262e57147754f"}}
